# Catastrophic-shape glob patterns harvested from real flutter / fluentui
# .gitignore files. Before v0.46 these were translated to PCRE and the regex was
# recompiled on every TGlob.Matches call, making the tree walk degrade to a
# multi-minute hang (and crash the process on a large/deep tree). With the
# direct linear matcher they are O(n*m) and allocation-free.
node_modules
dist/
**/ios/**/*.mode1v3
**/ios/**/*.mode2v3
**/ios/**/.tags*
**/ios/**/*sync/
**/ios/**/DerivedData/
**/AddTests/**
**.dcu
* - Copy*
packages/react-icons/src/icons
packages/react-icons/intermediate
**/*.Server/GeneratedArtifacts
